  "description": "EMIBEK crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H80 Dy4 N6 O19,C2 H6 O1,C2 H3 N1,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.586-5.041 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.30-172.92°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ4-O)(HL3)4(H2L3)2]·3H2O·EtOH·CH3CN (C88H95Dy4N7O23). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
